シでは？","ts":"1632194064.097900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=DZi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55281b94-55c2-4944-ba79-9cf09491e8bb","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"~おっCOBOLかな~","ts":"1632194046.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uj7uj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f88e162-917e-47d3-813f-8ece21f82c98","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今回は落ちてたからコピペしたけど英文そのままを意識したとかいう本当に最悪な文法ですごい\n```on alfred_script(q)\n  tell application \"System Events\"\n    set appName to name of the first process whose frontmost is true\n  end tell\n  if appName is \"Finder\" then\n    tell application \"Finder\"\n      set pathList to POSIX path of (folder of the front window as alias)\n      return pathList\n    end tell\n  else\n    tell application \"Path Finder\"\n      set pathList to POSIX path of the target of the front finder window\n      return pathList\n    end tell\n  end if\nend alfred_script```","ts":"1632194004.097200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QnbdE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c8e208c-e4de-47dc-bc27-c3d52f87c37a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとAppleScriptがヤバすぎる","ts":"1632193899.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yamaiyatsu","count":4,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U8CC7MDCL","UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4R6nF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ff5e6af-4854-48f1-b306-e49cb6e0943b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"サポートしてるランタイムが地獄のように古い上にビジュアルプログラミング・・・","ts":"1632193830.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cMO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dddecdc0-5423-46cc-bc6a-be69c3c2a34b","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"MacでAlfredはめっちゃ便利みたいなことを言ってたけど自分で